    <user>dimstar_suse</user>
    <comment>- Update to version 51.1.1:
  * Restore the gschema file
- Changes from version 51.1.0:
  * Added DnD support for Flatpak/Snap
  * Fixed little message

- Update to version 51.0.9:
  * Drop dead X11 code
  * Added new open/close emblems to stacks
  * Don't show for a brief moment a window icon in Dash
  * Use org.freedesktop.FileManager1 interface to open folders
  * Use sandboxing by default in .appimage files
  * Updated translations.

- Update to version 51.0.8:
  + Allows to change the extension name
  + Updated translations.

- Update to version 51.0.7:
  + Switch to track gnome-desktop-igons-ng tree, developed at
    https://gitlab.com/rastersoft/desktop-icons-ng
- Drop obsolete patches: desktop-icon-gnome-40.patch and
  desktop-icons-show-iso-file-icon.patch

  * desktopGrid: Open the rename popup only when item menu is</comment>
